+:: Mara Init [widget]
+<<widget "maraInit">>
+	<<if $mara is undefined>>
+		<<set $mara to { version: 1, metShop: false, metHouse: false, shopHelp: 0, houseHelp: 0, privateCollectionSeen: false, handlerProposalSeen: false, handlerRelationship: false, romanceUnlocked: false }>>
+	<<else>>
+		<<if $mara.version is undefined>><<set $mara.version to 1>><</if>>
+		<<if $mara.metShop is undefined>><<set $mara.metShop to false>><</if>>
+		<<if $mara.metHouse is undefined>><<set $mara.metHouse to false>><</if>>
+		<<if $mara.shopHelp is undefined>><<set $mara.shopHelp to 0>><</if>>
+		<<if $mara.houseHelp is undefined>><<set $mara.houseHelp to 0>><</if>>
+		<<if $mara.privateCollectionSeen is undefined>><<set $mara.privateCollectionSeen to false>><</if>>
+		<<if $mara.handlerProposalSeen is undefined>><<set $mara.handlerProposalSeen to false>><</if>>
+		<<if $mara.handlerRelationship is undefined>><<set $mara.handlerRelationship to false>><</if>>
+		<<if $mara.romanceUnlocked is undefined>><<set $mara.romanceUnlocked to false>><</if>>
+	<</if>>
+<</widget>>
+
+:: Mara Relationship Events
+<<if C.npc.Mara.love gte 100 and C.npc.Mara.trust gte 50 and !$mara.romanceUnlocked>>
+	<<link [[Talk to Mara about your relationship|Mara Romance Confession]]>><</link>>
+<</if>>
+<<if $mara.romanceUnlocked and C.npc.Mara.trust gt 70 and C.npc.Mara.dom gte 100 and !$mara.handlerProposalSeen>>
+	<<link [[Mara has something personal to ask|Mara Handler Proposal]]>><</link>>
+<</if>>
+
+:: Mara Romance Confession
+Mara sets aside her work and speaks more quietly. "You've become important to me. I would like us to be more than friends, if you feel the same."
+<br><br>
+<<link [[Accept her feelings|Mara Romance Accepted]]>><<set $mara.romanceUnlocked to true>><<run setup.loveInterestNpc.includes("Mara") || setup.loveInterestNpc.push("Mara")>><</link>>
+<br>
+<<link [[Ask for more time|Mara Pet Shop]]>><</link>>
+
+:: Mara Romance Accepted
+<<set $mara.romanceUnlocked to true>>
+Mara smiles, visibly relieved. "Then let's see where this takes us."
+<br><br>
+<<link [[Continue|Mara Pet Shop]]>><</link>>
+
+:: Mara Private Collection
+<<set $mara.privateCollectionSeen to true>><<npcincr Mara love 2>><<npcincr Mara dom 2>>
+Mara opens a cabinet in her private workshop. Inside are carefully maintained collars, cuffs, leads, and other specialist role-play accessories. "I opened the shop because I care about animals and training. But I also have a private interest in the symbolism of collars, rules, and consensual power exchange. I don't share this side of my life with just anyone."
+<br><br>
+<<link [[Ask her to explain more|Mara Pet Shop]]>><</link>>
+
+:: Mara Handler Proposal
+<<set $mara.handlerProposalSeen to true>>
+Mara takes a moment before speaking. "I trust you, and I care for you. I'd like to ask whether you'd be interested in a consensual Handler and pet relationship with me. We would agree on boundaries together, and you could change your mind at any time."
+<br><br>
+<<link [[Accept her proposal|Mara Handler Accepted]]>><<set $mara.handlerRelationship to true>><</link>>
+<br>
+<<link [[Ask for time to think|Mara Pet Shop]]>><</link>>
+<br>
+<<link [[Decline|Mara Pet Shop]]>><</link>
+
+:: Mara Handler Accepted
+<<set $mara.handlerRelationship to true>>
+Mara nods. "Then we'll establish our rules together, carefully and honestly."
+<br><br>
+<<link [[Continue|Mara Pet Shop]]>><</link>
